 "<h2>The Forge</h2><p class=\"muted small\">{0} {1} and {2} spare {3}.{4}</p>\n    <p class=\"muted small\">Embers come from the days you do your small thing, two on days you go all in, and they never fade. Spares are extra copies of a curio. The Forge never takes your last one, and nothing here is ever sold.</p>\n    <p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">{5}</p><ul class=\"furn forgel\">{6}</ul>{7}{8}\n    <div class=\"row\" style=\"justify-content:center\"><button class=\"ghost\" data-close>Close</button></div>": "<h2>鍛冶場</h2><p class=\"muted small\">{1}{0}つ、予備{2}{3}。{4}</p>\n    <p class=\"muted small\">残り火は小さなことをやった日にひとつ、全力でやった日にはふたつ手に入り、なくなることはありません。予備とは、同じ珍品の2つめ以降のこと。鍛冶場が最後のひとつを使うことはなく、ここで何かが売られることもありません。</p>\n    <p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">{5}</p><ul class=\"furn forgel\">{6}</ul>{7}{8}\n    <div class=\"row\" style=\"justify-content:center\"><button class=\"ghost\" data-close>閉じる</button></div>",
 "<p class=\"rv-title\">{0}</p>\n    <div class=\"stage\" id=\"stage\">{1}</div>\n    <p class=\"rv-hint\" id=\"rvHint\">Tap the card to turn it over</p>\n    <div id=\"rvAfter\" hidden style=\"display:grid;gap:10px;width:100%;justify-items:center\">\n      {2}\n      {3}\n      <button class=\"primary\" id=\"rvName\">Name your Forgeling</button>\n      <button class=\"ghost\" id=\"rvSkip\">Skip for now</button></div>": "<p class=\"rv-title\">{0}</p>\n    <div class=\"stage\" id=\"stage\">{1}</div>\n    <p class=\"rv-hint\" id=\"rvHint\">カードをタップしてめくりましょう</p>\n    <div id=\"rvAfter\" hidden style=\"display:grid;gap:10px;width:100%;justify-items:center\">\n      {2}\n      {3}\n      <button class=\"primary\" id=\"rvName\">名前をつける</button>\n      <button class=\"ghost\" id=\"rvSkip\">今はやめておく</button></div>",
 "<small id=\"hEmbers\">Something is ready</small>": "<small id=\"hEmbers\">作れるものがあります</small>",
 "<div class=\"hearthwrap\"><canvas id=\"hearthCv\" width=\"{0}\" height=\"{1}\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Your Forgelings sitting around a campfire\"></canvas>{2}</div>\n    <p class=\"hmsg\" id=\"hmsg\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">{3}</p>\n    <div class=\"actions hgrid\">\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hAffection\" {4} aria-describedby=\"hmsg\">{5}Sit with<small>Just for company</small></button>\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hSnack\" {6}>{7}Snack<small>+1 or +2</small></button>\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hStory\" {8}>{9}Story<small>+2</small></button>\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hPlay\" {10}>{11}Play<small>{12}</small></button>\n      {13}\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hForge\">{14}The Forge{15}</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"muted small hvis\">{16}</p>\n    {17}{18}\n    {19}\n    <div class=\"group hcompg\"><button class=\"rowl\" id=\"hComp\"><span class=\"rt\"><b>{20}</b><span class=\"rs\">{21}, bond {22} of 5{23}</span><span class=\"bondbar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i style=\"width:{24}%\"></i></span></span><span class=\"chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span></button></div>{25}\n    <div class=\"chips hmore\">{26}<button class=\"chip\" id=\"hShelf\">Curio shelf</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"hFurn\">By the fire · {27} of {28}</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"hKeeps\">Keepsakes</button>{29}<button class=\"chip\" id=\"hChange\">Change who is here</button>{30}</div>": "<div class=\"hearthwrap\"><canvas id=\"hearthCv\" width=\"{0}\" height=\"{1}\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"たき火を囲むフォージリングたち\"></canvas>{2}</div>\n    <p class=\"hmsg\" id=\"hmsg\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">{3}</p>\n    <div class=\"actions hgrid\">\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hAffection\" {4} aria-describedby=\"hmsg\">{5}そばにいる<small>ただ一緒に</small></button>\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hSnack\" {6}>{7}おやつ<small>+1か+2</small></button>\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hStory\" {8}>{9}お話<small>+2</small></button>\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hPlay\" {10}>{11}遊ぶ<small>{12}</small></button>\n      {13}\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hForge\">{14}鍛冶場{15}</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"muted small hvis\">{16}</p>\n    {17}{18}\n    {19}\n    <div class=\"group hcompg\"><button class=\"rowl\" id=\"hComp\"><span class=\"rt\"><b>{20}</b><span class=\"rs\">{21}、絆 {22}/5{23}</span><span class=\"bondbar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i style=\"width:{24}%\"></i></span></span><span class=\"chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span></button></div>{25}\n    <div class=\"chips hmore\">{26}<button class=\"chip\" id=\"hShelf\">珍品の棚</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"hFurn\">炉ばたの品 · {27}/{28}</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"hKeeps\">宝物</button>{29}<button class=\"chip\" id=\"hChange\">ここにいる子を変える</button>{30}</div>"
